Step 3: Materialization Script (feature_store/materialize.py)
Write an automated script to materialize offline features into the low-latency online database for real-time model scoring:

Python
from datetime import datetime, timezone
from feast import FeatureStore

# Initialize feature store pointing to your config directory
store = FeatureStore(repo_path=".")

# Materialize historical features up to the current timestamp into the online store
print("Starting feature materialization to online store...")
store.materialize(
    start_date=datetime(2025, 1, 1, tzinfo=timezone.utc),
    end_date=datetime.now(timezone.utc)
)
